RevengeProtect
--------------

Binary protector CLI (`RevengeProtect.exe`) based on VMProtect 3.x, customized for the Revenge toolchain.

Building (Windows, x64 Ultimate):
    msbuild vcproj\VMProtectCon.vcxproj /p:Configuration=Ultimate;Platform=x64 /p:PlatformToolset=v145 /m
    msbuild vcproj\VMProtectSDK.vcxproj /p:Configuration=Release;Platform=x64 /p:PlatformToolset=v145 /m

Outputs:
    bin\64\Ultimate\RevengeProtect.exe
    bin\64\Release\VMProtectSDK64.dll
